67
00:03:43.468 --> 00:03:47.761
So it outputs null and USA is a unique
faculty in country combination.

68
00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:53.192
In this video, you learned how to use
the select distinct statement to eliminate

69
00:03:53.192 --> 00:03:56.040
